<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal Telecom hits record high 4,200esc.</title>
<headline>Portugal Telecom hits record high 4,200esc.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Portugal Telecom SA hit a record high of 4,200 escudos on the Lisbon bourse and dealers said the share could gain even more before the session ended.</p>
</text>
